<h1>About</h1>

<h2>What it is</h2>
<p>Aibysitter reviews what AI coding agents are given and what they produce, after the fact. The lint page scores the rules files agents read (CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, Cursor rules, Copilot instructions, GEMINI.md, .windsurfrules). The <a asp-page="/GitHub">GitHub App</a>, in testing, reviews pull requests. It does not run, constrain, or monitor agents while they work.</p>

<h2>Who runs it</h2>
<p>Jon Bailey, as a solo side project. Free, no accounts.</p>

<h2>Source</h2>
<p>The repository is private until launch. When it opens, the code is MIT-licensed and the gallery content is CC0.</p>

